{"title":"o3 pro","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/920033228/0/marginalrevolution~o-pro.html","date":1749589242000,"content":"<p>It is very, very good.  Hallucinates far less than other models.  Can solve economics problems that o3 cannot.  It can be slow, but that is what we have Twitter scrolling for, right?  While we are waiting for o3 pro to answer a query we can <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/polynoamial/status/1932532770594857350\" target=\"_blank\">read about</a>…<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/WesRothMoney/status/1932546133982945501\" target=\"_blank\">o3 pro</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Sam Altman <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://blog.samaltman.com/the-gentle-singularity\" target=\"_blank\">comments on his blog</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/06/o3-pro.html\">o3 pro</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/920033228/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/920033228/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/920033228/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/920033228/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/920033228/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/920033228/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"http